  "prefLabel": "Pol 102.01 Scope of Council Authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 102.01 Scope of Council Authority. The council shall carry out the responsibilities delegated to it in RSA 188-F:26, and shall require hiring authorities to submit reports, documentation and information pertinent to the efficient functioning of the council, as described in these rules.\n\nSource. #1534, eff 2-17-80; ss by #1988, eff 3-25-82; ss by #2783, eff 7-27-84; ss by #4437, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00",
